  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SwedBio bas/samarbpr 2008</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SwedBio core/collab 2008 - SwedBio corecollabmult 08</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3. Ett&#xe5;rig f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngning av &quot;the Swedish International Biodiversity Programme,&quot; SwedBio. St&#xf6;det &#xe4;r en ihopslagning av de tv&#xe5; huvudsakliga aktiviteterna, tidigare i separerata avtal: a) samarbetsprogrammet (startat jan 2003, finansiering 2008 &#xe4;r 20 MSEK), samt b) SwedBio Bas (startat 2002, finansiering f&#xf6;r 2008 &#xe4;r 5.7 MSEK. SwedBio &#xe4;r ett gemensamt initiativ mellan Sida och CBM/SLU.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a one-year extension of the Swedish International Biodiversity Programme, SwedBio. The support is a merging of its two main activities, earlier under separate agreements: a) The Collaborative Programme (started Jan 2003, funding for 2008 is 20 MSEK), and b) SwedBio core (started 2002, funding for 2008 is 5,7 MSEK). SwedBio is a joint initiative by Sida and CBM/SLU.</narrative>
  </description>
